The '''Ilosian Spur''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that linked the [[Lesser Lantillian Route]]<ref name="YouTube" /> in the [[Mid Rim Territories]]<ref name="Appendix" /> with the [[Pabol Sleheyron]] route in [[Hutt Space]]. It branched off the Lesser Lantillian Route at the [[Bimmisaari system]],<ref name="YouTube" /> located in the [[Halla sector]]<ref name="Appendix" /> and [[Kashyyyk Region]] in grid square R-9 of the [[Standard Galactic Grid]], and passed through the [[Boz Pity system]]<ref name="YouTube" /> in the same [[sector]]<ref name="Appendix" /> and region but in grid square S-9. It then returned to square R-9 and entered Hutt Space, connecting to the [[Alee system]] and the [[Tal Nami system]], before reaching the [[Ilos Minor system]] on the Pabol Sleheyron in grid square R-10.<ref name="YouTube" />

==Behind the scenes==
In the current ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]], Ilosian Spur was mentioned in "Meet the Hutts: The Galaxy's Biggest Crime Lords," a video in the ''[[Star Wars: Galaxy Guide]]'' series published on the official ''Star Wars'' [[Wikipedia:YouTube|YouTube]] channel on [[September 16]], [[2026]]. It reused a map showing the Ilosian Spur<ref name="YouTube" /> that had been created by the artist [[Modi]] for ''[[The Essential Atlas]]'', a [[2009]] reference book written by [[Jason Fry]] and [[Daniel Wallace]] that marked the first mention of the [[Ilosian Spur|route]] in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity.<ref name="TEA">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

